    var token = new JObject();
    token["Foo"] = new JValue(5);

    //// Act
    var errors = schema.Validate(token);

    //// Assert
    Assert.AreEqual(0, errors.Count());
}
```

The errors collection will, in fact, contain 2 NullExpected errors


